<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan Sampo Feb sales fall 11.78 pct.</title>
<headline>Taiwan Sampo Feb sales fall 11.78 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan electronic product maker Sampo Corp said on Friday its sales revenue in February fell 11.78 percent to T$1.366 billion from T$1.549 billion in February 1996.</p>
<p>For the first two months of 1997, Sampo's combined sales revenue totalled T$2.914 billion, down 12.9 percent from T$3.346 billion in the same period in 1996, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>Sampo did not give a reason for the sales drops.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (5080815)</p>
</text>
